{"abstract":"Nearest neighbor search is a computational primitive whose efficiency is paramount to many applications. As such, the literature recently blossomed with many works focusing on improving its effectiveness in an approximate setting. In this overview paper, we review recent advances of the state of the art and discuss some trends. Given the practical relevance of the problem, new approaches need to be thoroughly benchmarked. We therefore review some recent benchmarking efforts and provide advice on the benchmarking pipeline.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Aumüller, Martin","Ceccarello, Matteo"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-712501"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Italy"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Padova"],"keyword":["Approximate nearest neighbor","Benchmarking","Computational efficiency","Nearest neighbor search","State of the art"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"recent approaches and trends in approximate nearest neighbor search","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://sites.computer.org/debull/A23sept/p89.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-712501","ids":["itu-20239d14-6dff-4b27-bd57-f85484104308"],"keyword":["Approximate nearest neighbor","Benchmarking","Computational efficiency","Nearest neighbor search","State of the art"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-998936A4D4F945C3BD62C1F4E14FC641"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://sites.computer.org/debull/A23sept/p89.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2"