{"abstract":"Analyzing data from large experimental suites is a daily task for anyone doing experimental algorithmics. In this paper we report on several approaches we tried for this seemingly mundane task in a similarity search setting, reflecting on the challenges it poses. We conclude by proposing a workflow, which can be implemented using several tools, that allows to analyze experimental data with confidence. The extended version of this paper and the support code are provided at https://github.com/Cecca/running-experiments.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Aumüller, Martin","Ceccarello, Matteo"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384555"],"event":{"acronym":"SISAP","title":"International Conference on Similarity Search and Applications"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Italy"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Padova"],"keyword":["Data analysis","Experimental algorithmics","Similarity search","Support code","Workflow development"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"running experiments with confidence and sanity","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/85506389/running_experiments.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-384555","identifier":[{"id":"85093854900","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-df94bc0c-ec7f-4976-b35e-f89c5dc3a69a"],"keyword":["Data analysis","Experimental algorithmics","Similarity search","Support code","Workflow development"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-C321857CA20633E9FB27CFC545759029"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/85506389/running_experiments.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science","IT University of Copenhagen, Theoretical Computer Science, Algorithms"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"it","key":"university of padova","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Padova","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin","key":"aumüllerpau","last":"Aumüller","locid":"5f52759c-418a-41b7-bbdb-050492677284","name":"Aumüller, Martin","orcid":"0000-0002-7212-6476","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Matteo","key":"ceccarellopau","last":"Ceccarello","name":"Ceccarello, Matteo","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-030-60936-8_31","pages":"18-32","publisher":"Springer","status":"p","title":"International Conference on Similarity Search and Applications"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85093854900"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-df94bc0c-ec7f-4976-b35e-f89c5dc3a69a"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Running Experiments with Confidence and Sanity","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-384555","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"This book constitutes the refereed proceedings of the 13th International Conference on Similarity Search and Applications, SISAP 2020, held in Copenhagen, Denmark, in September/October 2020. The conference was held virtually due to the COVID-19 pandemic. The 19 full papers presented together with 12 short and 2 doctoral symposium papers were carefully reviewed and selected from 50 submissions. The papers are organized in topical sections named: scalable similarity search; similarity measures, search, and indexing; high-dimensional data and intrinsic dimensionality; clustering; artificial intelligence and similarity; demo and position papers; and doctoral symposium.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Satoh, Shin'ichi","Vadicamo, Lucia","Zimek, Arthur","Carrara, Fabio","Bartolini, Ilaria","Aumüller, Martin","Jónsson, Björn Þór","Pagh, Rasmus"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-584728"],"event":{"end":"2020-10-02","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2020-09-30","title":"International Conference on Similarity Search and Applications","year":"2020"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East","Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Italy","Japan"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Istituto di Scienza e Tecnologie dell'Informazione","National Institute of Informatics","University of Bologna"],"keyword":["Artificial intelligence","Clustering algorithms","Data mining","Databases","Image processing","Information retrieval","Internet","Machine learning","Mathematics of Computing","Pattern recognition","Search engines","Semantics","Similarity search","World Wide Web"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"similarity search and applications 000000000013th international conference sisap 0000000020